    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/fc853c06bd1affc6d8b73f2f288f0e89.avif?t=1749948466\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the roofs of panel houses, jump on garages, unscrew light bulbs in a shabby entrance. Or just wander aimlessly around a small courtyard, past old panel five-story buildings. There are no goals in this game other than those you set for yourself. In terms of gameplay, this is a classic walking simulator in recognizable scenery for people from the CIS. Just relax and spend time wandering around this place filled with post-Soviet atmosphere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/00f41ee38f93be1d5708e14c3b8ea836.avif?t=1749948466\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Beat nettles with a stick</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/59cf2173f670b96c41434d0317845ca3.poster.avif?t=1749948466\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/59cf2173f670b96c41434d0317845ca3.webm?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/59cf2173f670b96c41434d0317845ca3.mp4?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Unscrew light bulbs in the entrance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/d44348fb5fa24d5704b41884338a7e82.poster.avif?t=1749948466\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/d44348fb5fa24d5704b41884338a7e82.webm?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/d44348fb5fa24d5704b41884338a7e82.mp4?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Jump on roofs and garages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/98a9cafe97d9f464156a1503c2848653.poster.avif?t=1749948466\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/98a9cafe97d9f464156a1503c2848653.webm?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/98a9cafe97d9f464156a1503c2848653.mp4?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Find and collect memes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/05096b98b227814dd165900eb2119741.poster.avif?t=1749948466\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/05096b98b227814dd165900eb2119741.webm?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/05096b98b227814dd165900eb2119741.mp4?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/e99cfe86c6396859f4833b0a794691f9.avif?t=1749948466\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thanks to the advanced graphics of the 2005 Unity engine, you can fully enjoy the atmosphere of a quiet residential area.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/8fd939d9d4321f76121d602299d00402.poster.avif?t=1749948466\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/8fd939d9d4321f76121d602299d00402.webm?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/8fd939d9d4321f76121d602299d00402.mp4?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/fc853c06bd1affc6d8b73f2f288f0e89.avif?t=1749948466\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the roofs of panel houses, jump on garages, unscrew light bulbs in a shabby entrance. Or just wander aimlessly around a small courtyard, past old panel five-story buildings. There are no goals in this game other than those you set for yourself. In terms of gameplay, this is a classic walking simulator in recognizable scenery for people from the CIS. Just relax and spend time wandering around this place filled with post-Soviet atmosphere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/00f41ee38f93be1d5708e14c3b8ea836.avif?t=1749948466\" width=666 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Beat nettles with a stick</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/59cf2173f670b96c41434d0317845ca3.poster.avif?t=1749948466\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/59cf2173f670b96c41434d0317845ca3.webm?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/59cf2173f670b96c41434d0317845ca3.mp4?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Unscrew light bulbs in the entrance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/d44348fb5fa24d5704b41884338a7e82.poster.avif?t=1749948466\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/d44348fb5fa24d5704b41884338a7e82.webm?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/d44348fb5fa24d5704b41884338a7e82.mp4?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Jump on roofs and garages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/98a9cafe97d9f464156a1503c2848653.poster.avif?t=1749948466\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/98a9cafe97d9f464156a1503c2848653.webm?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/98a9cafe97d9f464156a1503c2848653.mp4?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Find and collect memes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/05096b98b227814dd165900eb2119741.poster.avif?t=1749948466\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/05096b98b227814dd165900eb2119741.webm?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747060/extras/05096b98b227814dd165900eb2119741.mp4?t=1749948466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"